# -----------------------------------------------------------
#  [*] Dockerfile.tests.dockerignore — the test image's context
#
#  Read instead of .dockerignore for Dockerfile.tests (BuildKit
#  picks the file named after the Dockerfile). The app reaches
#  the test image through the production image it is built on,
#  so this build needs only the suite: phpunit.xml and tests/.
#
#  Used by:
#    - runTests.sh (this folder) — the test image's build
# -----------------------------------------------------------
*
!phpunit.xml
!tests
